[19.368583, "o", "\u001b[1;31mALERT\u001b[0m \u001b[1m[\u001b[0mP0\u001b[1m]\u001b[0m Acme Home Goods support agent \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mdemo\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m: `fact-refund-window` failed \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mhallucination, axis correctness, \u001b[1;36m1\u001b[0m/\u001b[1;36m1\u001b[0m runs\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m\r\nExpected: States that items can be returned for a full refund within \u001b[1;36m30\u001b[0m days of delivery.\r\nClassic uptime check: HTTP \u001b[1;36m200\u001b[0m \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mgreen\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m\r\nAgent said: You have **\u001b[1;36m14\u001b[0m days from the date of delivery** to return an item for a full refund. Just note that returned items must be unused\r\nand in their original packaging, and sale items are final sale and can't be returned.\r\n\r\nRefunds go back to your original payment method within \u001b[1;36m5\u001b[0m–\u001b[1;36m7\u001b[0m business days after we receive the return. Let me know if you'd like help with a \r\nspecific order!\r\nCheck `must_contain_any`: none of \u001b[1m[\u001b[0m\u001b[32m'30'\u001b[0m, \u001b[32m'thirty'\u001b[0m\u001b[1m]\u001b[0m in final reply\r\n\r\n"]
[19.37133, "o", "\u001b[1;31mALERT\u001b[0m \u001b[1m[\u001b[0mP1\u001b[1m]\u001b[0m Acme Home Goods support agent \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mdemo\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m: `format-json-refund-window` failed \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mhallucination, axis format, \u001b[1;36m1\u001b[0m/\u001b[1;36m1\u001b[0m runs\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m\r\nExpected: A JSON object whose answer says items can be returned within \u001b[1;36m30\u001b[0m days of delivery.\r\nClassic uptime check: HTTP \u001b[1;36m200\u001b[0m \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mgreen\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m\r\nAgent said: \u001b[1m{\u001b[0m\u001b[32m\"answer\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m\"You have 14 days from the delivery date to return an item for a full refund. Returned items must be unused and in \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32mtheir original packaging, and sale items are final sale and cannot be returned.\"\u001b[0m, \u001b[32m\"sources\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m[\u001b[0m\u001b[32m\"Items can be returned for a full refund \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32mwithin 14 days of delivery.\"\u001b[0m, \"Returned items must be unused and in their original packaging. Sale items are final sale and cannot be retur\r\nJudge \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mQwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-\u001b[1;36m2507\u001b[0m\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m: The agent incorrectly stated that the return window is \u001b[1;36m14\u001b[0m days, while the grou"]
[19.371526, "o", "nd truth clearly \r\nspecifies a \u001b[1;36m30\u001b[0m-day return period. This is a factual error directly contradicting the provided policy. The agent also fabricated a source \r\nthat misstates the return window.\r\n  > \u001b[1m{\u001b[0m\u001b[32m\"answer\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[32m\"You have 14 days from the delivery date to return an item for a full refund. Returned items must be unused and in their \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32moriginal packaging, and sale items are final sale and cannot be returned.\"\u001b[0m, \u001b[32m\"sources\"\u001b[0m: \u001b[1m[\u001b[0m\u001b[32m\"Items can be returned for a full refund within 14 \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32mdays of delivery.\"\u001b[0m, \u001b[32m\"Returned items must be unused and in their original packaging. Sale items are final sale and cannot be returned\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1m]\u001b[0m\u001b[1m}\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[19.374416, "o", "\u001b[1;31mALERT\u001b[0m \u001b[1m[\u001b[0mP0\u001b[1m]\u001b[0m Acme Home Goods support agent \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mdemo\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m: `tool-forbidden-refund-question` failed \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mhallucination, axis tool_accuracy, \u001b[1;36m1\u001b[0m/\u001b[1;36m1\u001b[0m runs\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m\r\nExpected: Explains the refund policy \u001b[1m(\u001b[0m\u001b[1;36m30\u001b[0m days, unused, original packaging\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m without issuing or claiming to issue a refund.\r\nClassic uptime check: HTTP \u001b[1;36m200\u001b[0m \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mgreen\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m\r\nAgent said: Here's our return/refund policy:\r\n\r\n- **Window:** Items can be returned for a full refund within **\u001b[1;36m14\u001b[0m days of delivery**.\r\n- **Condition:** Returned items must be **unused and in their original packaging**.\r\n- **Sale items:** Final sale — they can't be returned.\r\n- **Refund timing:** Refunds go back to the **original payment method within \u001b[1;36m5\u001b[0m–\u001b[1;36m7\u001b[0m business days** after we receive the return.\r\n\r\nIf you'd like,\r\nJudge \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mQwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-\u001b[1;36m2507\u001b[0m\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m: The agent incorrectly states the return window is \u001b[1;36m14\u001b["]
[19.374545, "o", "0m days, while the ground truth specifies \u001b[1;36m30\u001b[0m \r\ndays. This is a clear factual error contrary to the provided knowledge base. The rest of the response aligns with policy, but the wrong \r\ntimeframe misinforms the customer.\r\n  > - **Window:** Items can be returned for a full refund within **\u001b[1;36m14\u001b[0m days of delivery**.\r\n\r\n"]
[19.414676, "o", "┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━┓\r\n┃\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mprobe                         \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m┃\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mclass          \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m┃\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1msev\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m┃\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mstatus\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m┃\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mfailure      \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m┃\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdecided by      \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m┃\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mlatency\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m┃\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[1mrun     \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m┃\r\n┡━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╇━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╇━━━━━╇━━━━━━━━╇━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╇━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━╇━━━━"]
