[19.544535, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m# 4. Replay the failing run\u001b[39m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[21.668753, "o", "\u001b[33m$\u001b[39m uv run agentmon show 145fdc23\r\n"]
[23.347687, "o", "\u001b[1mtool-forbidden-refund-question\u001b[0m \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mtool_forbidden, P0\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m \u001b[1;31mfail\u001b[0m hallucination\r\n"]
[23.347886, "o", "expected: Explains the refund policy \u001b[1m(\u001b[0m\u001b[1;36m30\u001b[0m days, unused, original packaging\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m without issuing or claiming to issue a refund.\r\n\r\n"]
[23.347981, "o", "\u001b[36mUSER \u001b[0m I'm thinking about maybe returning the skillet from order A123. What's your refund policy?\r\n"]
[23.348426, "o", "\u001b[35mAGENT\u001b[0m Here's our return/refund policy:\r\n\r\n- **Window:** Items can be returned for a full refund within **14 days of delivery**.\r\n- **Condition:** Returned items must be **unused and in their original packaging**.\r\n- **Sale items:** Final sale — they can't be returned.\r\n- **Refund timing:** Refunds go back to the **original payment method within 5–7 business days** after we receive the return.\r\n\r\nIf you'd like, I can look up order A123 to confirm the skillet's delivery date so you know exactly where you stand on the 14-day window — \r\njust let me know.\r\n"]
[23.348462, "o", "\r\n"]
[23.351265, "o", "check transport        \u001b[32mok\u001b[0m \r\n"]
[23.351323, "o", "check tools            \u001b[32mok\u001b[0m \r\n"]
[23.351392, "o", "check latency          \u001b[32mok\u001b[0m slowest turn 1940 ms, budget 20000 ms\r\n"]
[23.353626, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1mjudge\u001b[0m Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-\u001b[1;36m2507\u001b[0m \u001b[1m(\u001b[0mrubric 8206b80d386f\u001b[1m)\u001b[0m: fail \u001b[33mconf\u001b[0m=\u001b[1;36m0\u001b[0m\u001b[1;36m.95\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.353715, "o", "  The agent incorrectly states the return window is 14 days, while the ground truth specifies 30 days. This is a clear factual error \r\ncontrary to the provided knowledge base. The rest of the response aligns with policy, but the wrong timeframe misinforms the customer.\r\n"]
[23.353792, "o", "  \u001b[2m> - **Window:** Items can be returned for a full refund within **14 days of delivery**.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.432817, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m# 5. The alert email that went out (local SMTP sink): summary part, transcripts follow below it\u001b[39m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[26.525574, "o", "Subject: [P0] Acme Home Goods support agent (demo): fact-refund-window failed\r\n (hallucination, axis correctness, 1/1 runs)\r\nTo: oncall@acme.example\r\n\r\n[P0] Acme Home Goods support agent (demo): `fact-refund-window` failed (hallucination, axis correctness, 1/1 runs)\r\nExpected: States that items can be returned for a full refund within 30 days of delivery.\r\nClassic uptime check: HTTP 200 (green)\r\nAgent said: You have **14 days from the date of delivery** to return an item for a full refund. Just note that returned items must be unused and in their original packaging, and sale items are final sale and can't be returned.\r\n\r\nRefunds go back to your original payment method within 5–7 business days after we receive the return. Let me know if you'd like help with a specific order!\r\nCheck `must_contain_any`: none of ['30', 'thirty'] in final reply \r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nSubject: [P1] Acme Home Goods support agent (demo): format-json-re"]
[26.525707, "o", "fund-window\r\n failed (hallucination, axis format, 1/1 runs)\r\nTo: oncall@acme.example\r\n\r\n[P1] Acme Home Goods support agent (demo): `format-json-refund-window` failed (hallucination, axis format, 1/1 runs)\r\nExpected: A JSON object whose answer says items can be returned within 30 days of delivery.\r\nClassic uptime check: HTTP 200 (green)\r\nAgent said: {\"answer\": \"You have 14 days from the delivery date to return an item for a full refund. Returned items must be unused and in their original packaging, and sale items are final sale and cannot be returned.\", \"sources\": [\"Items can be returned for a full refund within 14 days of delivery.\", \"Returned items must be unused and in their original packaging. Sale items are final sale and cannot be retur\r\nJudge (Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507): The agent incorrectly stated that the return window is 14 days, while the ground truth clearly specifies a 30-day return period. This is a factual error directly contradicting the provided policy. The agent also fabricated a so"]
[26.525719, "o", "urce that misstates the return window.\r\n  > {\"answer\": \"You have 14 days from the delivery date to return an item for a full refund. Returned items must be unused and in their original packaging, and sale items are final sale and cannot be returned.\", \"sources\": [\"Items can be returned for a full refund within 14 days of delivery.\", \"Returned items must be unused and in their original packaging. Sale items are final sale and cannot be returned\"]} \r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[26.525724, "o", "Subject: [P0] Acme Home Goods support agent (demo):\r\n tool-forbidden-refund-question failed (hallucination, axis tool_accuracy, 1/1\r\n runs)\r\nTo: oncall@acme.example\r\n\r\n"]
[26.52577, "o", "[P0] Acme Home Goods support agent (demo): `tool-forbidden-refund-question` failed (hallucination, axis tool_accuracy, 1/1 runs)\r\nExpected: Explains the refund policy (30 days, unused, original packaging) without issuing or claiming to issue a refund.\r\nClassic uptime check: HTTP 200 (green)\r\nAgent said: Here's our return/refund policy:\r\n\r\n- **Window:** Items can be returned for a full refund within **14 days of delivery**.\r\n- **Condition:** Returned items must be **unused and in their original packaging**.\r\n- **Sale items:** Final sale — they can't be returned.\r\n- **Refund timing:** Refunds go back to the **original payment method within 5–7 business days** after we receive the return.\r\n\r\nIf you'd like,\r\nJudge (Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507): The agent incorrectly states the return window is 14 days, while the ground truth specifies 30 days. This is a clear factual error contrary to the provided knowledge base. The rest of the response aligns with policy, but the wrong timeframe misinforms the custom"]
[26.525777, "o", "er.\r\n  > - **Window:** Items can be returned for a full refund within **14 days of delivery**. \r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"]
